{"conversation_id":"046d4660-152e-4b12-a0fb-7a5de4dbddd2","status":"SUCCESS","response":"# TTQS Independent Review Report: Deliverable 0054 (Revision R14)\n\n---\n\n## 1. Candidate Identification \u0026 Integrity Verification\n\n- **Deliverable ID**: 0054\n- **Revision**: R14\n- **Document Title**: 學員遴選及教材審議作業程序\n- **Target File**: `E:\\TTQS\\_TTQS_ONE_REVIEW_SYNC_0036_R08_20261016\\docs\\ttqs-quality-20261016\\quality-review\\0054_R14\\candidate\\0054_R14.docx`\n- **Candidate SHA-256 (Observed Before Review)**:  \n  `3d000e580b9cb1247fd984ebb0c8f5f817fce08ce7c368cc1799c95a111a979c`\n- **Candidate SHA-256 (Observed After Review)**:  \n  `3d000e580b9cb1247fd984ebb0c8f5f817fce08ce7c368cc1799c95a111a979c`  \n  *(Exact byte-level match confirmed; strictly read-only audit, no modifications made)*\n- **Overall Semantic Verdict**: **PASS**\n\n---\n\n## 2. Criterion-by-Criterion Evaluation\n\n| # | Evaluation Criterion | Verdict | Key Evidence Locator \u0026 Summary |\n|---|----------------------|:-------:|--------------------------------|\n| 1 | **Official Requirement Match, Source Locator \u0026 Title-Blind Distinctiveness** | **PASS** | **[PDF p. 1, P5–P6, P9]**: Exact official text matched:「依學員遴選標準及流程遴選， 教材由講師及顧問推薦須經訓練管理委員會通過。」Source locator cites official evidence table page 4, item 12a (I12-E02). Genre is Standard Operating Procedure (SOP). Title-blind test passes through the unique twin workflow of applicant rubric scoring + committee material approval. |\n| 2 | **Administrative Workflow Executability \u0026 Operational Mechanics** | **PASS** | **[PDF pp. 1–2, 5–10; Tables 1, 2, 7, 8, 9, 11]**: Clear segregation of duties (Table 2 \u0026 Section 二); 7-step execution sequence (Table 11); explicit thresholds (75-point cutoff, unrounded comparison, tie-breaking sequence); exception protocols with concrete deadlines (Table 7: 1-day defect notification, 3-day supplement window, 2-day primary reply, 24-hr reserve reply); 3-year retention schedule (to 2029-11-15); 4 monitoring indicators with zero-denominator definitions. |\n| 3 | **Documented Committee Approval for Materials vs. Admission/Manager Sign-Off** | **PASS** | **[PDF p. 3 Table 2; p. 5 Table 6; p. 10 Table 11 \u0026 Minutes]**: Materials recommended by lecturer and reviewed by consultant are submitted to the Training Management Committee for formal resolution on 2026-10-26 (v0.1 approved for class-only use). This is strictly distinguished from applicant qualification/scoring by administrative volunteers and final course announcement/handoff by the Chairman. |\n| 4 | **Completeness, Consistency \u0026 Mathematical Reproducibility** | **PASS** | **[PDF pp. 3–4, 6, 8; Tables 4, 5, 8, 10]**: Full mathematical reconciliation confirmed:\u003cbr\u003e• $92 \\times 40\\% + 95 \\times 30\\% + 93 \\times 30\\% = 36.8 + 28.5 + 27.9 = 93.2$ (Table 4)\u003cbr\u003e• $32\\text{ received} = 28\\text{ eligible} + 4\\text{ ineligible}$ (Table 5 R3; Table 8 rates: $32/32=100\\%$, $28/32=87.5\\%$)\u003cbr\u003e• $28\\text{ scored} \\rightarrow 25 \\ge 75\\text{ pts}$ ($20\\text{ primary} + 5\\text{ reserve} + 3\\text{ below threshold}$)\u003cbr\u003e• Primary rank 14 declines on 2026-11-02; 1st reserve (78.5 pts) accepts within 24 hr; final 20 confirmed ($20/20 = 100\\%$).\u003cbr\u003e• Table 10 provides sensitivity adjustment ($12/12=100\\%$). Zero arithmetic contradictions. |\n| 5 | **SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC Boundary \u0026 Replacement Register Coverage** | **PASS** | **[PDF pp. 1, 2, 4, 5, 7, 10; Tables 1, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9, 10, Minutes]**: Pervasive demarcation: \"示範文件｜非本會實際紀錄｜修訂日期：2026-10-05｜生效日期：未生效\", \"非本會實際紀錄\", \"演練值\", \"換填指引\". No forged signatures, real participant names, or fake external certificates. All 71 operational synthetic facts in `synthetic_replacement_register_R13.csv` are accounted for in the text. |\n| 6 | **Boundary Separation from Neighbors (0053 / I12-E01 and 0055 / I12-E03)** | **PASS** | **[PDF p. 1 P9; Tables 2, 6, 11]**: Distinct operational boundaries:\u003cbr\u003e• vs. **0053 (I12-E01)**: 0054 does not perform multi-year analytical curriculum reviews across 5 dimensions, nor calculate historical gap analyses.\u003cbr\u003e• vs. **0055 (I12-E03)**: Lecturers provide course recommendations, but 0054 contains zero faculty selection criteria, lecturer qualification scoring, or appointment letter (聘書) issuance mechanics. Keywords `0053`, `0055`, `聘書`, `師資遴選`, `切合性檢討` count = 0. |\n| 7 | **Practical Usability by Association Volunteer Administrators \u0026 Evaluators** | **PASS** | **[Entire Candidate]**: Realistic association context (原始點關懷服務實務班, 長者訪視, 偏鄉長者關懷, 志工排班). Zero prohibited placeholder tokens (`待填`, `待核`, `空白表`, `保持空白`, `會後填寫`, `TBD`, `TODO`, `XXXX`, `____` count = 0). Strict typographic compliance: body text $\\ge 10.5\\text{ pt}$, table text $\\ge 9.5\\text{ pt}$ (0 violations). |\n| 8 | **Direct Visual Readability \u0026 Layout Inspection** | **PASS** | **[Rendered Pages 1–10]**: Direct visual inspection completed for all 10 pages (`page-1.png` through `page-10.png`) and `0054_R14.pdf`. R14 pagination repair successfully consolidated the layout to exactly 10 pages. Repeated table headers present on split tables across pages 3, 4, 6, 9, and 10. No orphan headings, no row splitting, clean margins, crisp readability. |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Title-Blind Identification \u0026 Neighborhood Differentiation\n\n1. **Title-Blind Test**:\n   - If document title, file name, and deliverable ID are masked, any evaluator can identify this work product by its specific dual mechanism: (1) volunteer applicant recruitment, 3-dimensional rubric scoring ($40\\%/30\\%/30\\%$), and reserve replacement roster, coupled with (2) lecturer-recommended, consultant-reviewed modular training materials (`原始點志工關懷服務練習頁 v0.1`, Units 1–3) receiving formal Training Management Committee approval.\n2. **Differentiating from 0053 (I12-E01)**:\n   - 0053 is an **analysis/evaluation report** reviewing multi-year course fit across 5 elements (學員、教材、師資、教學方法、訓練設施) with statistical achievement rates.\n   - 0054 is an **operational standard operating procedure** with a concrete worked cohort ledger for selecting students and approving syllabus materials for a single class.\n3. **Differentiating from 0055 (I12-E03)**:\n   - 0055 governs **faculty recruitment, evaluation, committee approval, and appointment letters (聘書)**.\n   - 0054 treats the lecturer as an external input provider for course materials; it contains no lecturer hiring criteria, lecturer evaluation sheets, or appointment contract records.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Replacement Register \u0026 Fact Audit\n\n- **Replacement Register File**: `synthetic_replacement_register_R13.csv`\n- **Total Registered Rows Audited**: 71 rows\n- **Operational Fact Coverage**: 71 / 71 ($100\\%$)\n  - All synthetic dates (application window `2026-10-01~10-15`, applicant receipt `10-07`, committee meeting `2026-10-26`, decline `2026-11-02`, layout correction \u0026 consultant check `2026-11-07`, revision deadline \u0026 chair confirmation `2026-11-08`, handover `2026-11-09`, class date `2026-11-15`, retention start `2026-11-16`, sensitivity date `2026-11-22`, retention end `2029-11-15`), role titles, quantities, percentages, scoring formulas, and committee resolutions match the registered values.\n- **Header Metadata Observation**:\n  - The date `2026-10-05` appears on page 1 header line: `修訂日期：2026-10-05｜生效日期：未生效`. This is document template metadata (SOP revision date) rather than an operational scenario event, correctly marked `未生效`.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Scope of Review \u0026 Inspected Artifacts\n\n- **Files Inspected Directly**:\n  1. Candidate DOCX: `0054_R14.docx` (ZIP XML, paragraphs, styles, tables, and font runs)\n  2. Candidate Rendered PDF: `0054_R14.pdf` (10 pages)\n  3. Candidate Page Render Images: `page-1.png` through `page-10.png` (Direct visual inspection of typography, cell borders, repeat headers, pagination)\n  4. Authoritative Blueprint: `UNIQUE_BLUEPRINT_0054.json`\n  5. Official Excerpt: `official_checkbox_page4_excerpt.txt`\n  6. Official Source PDF: `official_evidence_table_source.pdf`\n  7. Synthetic Replacement Register: `synthetic_replacement_register_R13.csv` (71 rows)\n  8. Technical Receipts: `repair_receipt_R14.json`, `page_text_and_structure.txt`\n  9. Negative Neighbor: `0053_R03.docx` and `UNIQUE_BLUEPRINT_0053.json`\n- **Exclusions \u0026 Clarifications**:\n  - No 0055 candidate was inspected (not provided, strictly compared against official page 4 line text).\n  - Note: `evidence\\render\\page-11.png` is an unpurged leftover artifact from R13 (prior to pagination repair); the current R14 PDF has exactly 10 pages and renders cleanly across `page-1.png` through `page-10.png`.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Findings \u0026 Requested Repairs\n\n- **Defects Found**: None.\n- **Severity**: None.\n- **Specific Repairs Requested**: None. Candidate `0054_R14.docx` fully satisfies the acceptance contract for checkbox sequence 054 / requirement I12-E02.\n\n*(This review constitutes an independent technical and semantic audit of the candidate artifact; it does not grant official REAL status or replace formal human organizational governance.)*\n","duration_seconds":451.1566311,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":198233,"output_tokens":37104,"thinking_tokens":19048,"cache_read_tokens":3648444,"total_tokens":235337}}
